  "components": [
    {
      "name": "Primary Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "The one filled action on a card: indigo in light, marigold in dark.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn-primary\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M15 3h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-4\"/><path d=\"m10 17 5-5-5-5\"/><path d=\"M15 12H3\"/></svg>Check in</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-primary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;height:40px;padding:0 16px;border-radius:10px;font:500 14px/1 \"Anek Latin\",ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color .15s ease-out,transform .15s ease-out;background:var(--primary,#1e2756);color:var(--primary-foreground,#fff);border:0;box-shadow:0 1px 2px hsl(228 40% 20% / .06),0 2px 6px -2px hsl(228 40% 20% / .08);}.ds-btn-primary:focus-visible{outline:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--background,#f6f7fb),0 0 0 4px var(--ring,#4a57a8)}.ds-btn-primary:active{transform:translateY(1px)}.ds-btn-primary:hover{background:var(--primary-hover,#2a3570)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Outline Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-outline",
      "description": "Secondary actions such as Review or Check out.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn-outline\">Review</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-outline{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;height:40px;padding:0 16px;border-radius:10px;font:500 14px/1 \"Anek Latin\",ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color .15s ease-out,transform .15s ease-out;background:var(--card,#fff);color:var(--foreground,#141a33);border:1px solid var(--input,#d3d7e5);}.ds-btn-outline:focus-visible{outline:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--background,#f6f7fb),0 0 0 4px var(--ring,#4a57a8)}.ds-btn-outline:active{transform:translateY(1px)}.ds-btn-outline:hover{background:var(--accent,#e9ecf7)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Success Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-success",
      "description": "Approve actions: deep present ink with white text.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn-success\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg>Approve</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-success{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;height:40px;padding:0 16px;border-radius:10px;font:500 14px/1 \"Anek Latin\",ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color .15s ease-out,transform .15s ease-out;background:var(--present-ink,#22704a);color:#fff;border:0;box-shadow:0 1px 2px hsl(228 40% 20% / .06),0 2px 6px -2px hsl(228 40% 20% / .08);}.ds-btn-success:focus-visible{outline:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--background,#f6f7fb),0 0 0 4px var(--ring,#4a57a8)}.ds-btn-success:active{transform:translateY(1px)}.ds-btn-success:hover{background:color-mix(in oklab,var(--present-ink,#22704a) 90%,transparent)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Text Input",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "input",
      "description": "40px field on white with an indigo focus border and soft ring.",
      "html": "<input class=\"ds-input\" placeholder=\"Reason for leave\">",
      "css": ".ds-input{height:40px;width:260px;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--input,#d3d7e5);border-radius:10px;background:var(--card,#fff);color:var(--foreground,#141a33);font:400 14px \"Anek Latin\",ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;outline:none;transition:border-color .15s,box-shadow .15s}.ds-input::placeholder{color:var(--muted-foreground,#545b78)}.ds-input:focus-visible{border-color:var(--ring,#4a57a8);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px color-mix(in oklab,var(--ring,#4a57a8) 20%,transparent)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rail Navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "nav-item-active",
      "description": "Indigo rail items; the active one carries a marigold stitch at the edge.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-rail\"><p class=\"ds-rail-group\">Team</p><a class=\"ds-rail-item ds-active\" href=\"#\"><span class=\"ds-rail-mark\"></span>Dashboard</a><a class=\"ds-rail-item\" href=\"#\">Approvals<span class=\"ds-rail-count\">6</span></a><a class=\"ds-rail-item\" href=\"#\">Reports</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-rail{display:grid;gap:2px;width:228px;padding:12px;background:var(--rail,#1e2756);font-family:\"Anek Latin\",ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-rail-group{margin:0;padding:0 12px 6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;color:var(--rail-muted,#a1a9d4)}.ds-rail-item{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;height:40px;padding:0 12px;border-radius:12px;font-size:15px;color:color-mix(in oklab,var(--rail-foreground,#dce0f5) 85%,transparent);text-decoration:none;transition:background-color .15s}.ds-rail-item:hover{background:color-mix(in oklab,var(--rail-raised,#2a3570) 70%,transparent);color:#fff}.ds-rail-item:focus-visible{outline:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--marigold,#f2b33d)}.ds-active{background:var(--rail-raised,#2a3570);color:#fff}.ds-rail-mark{position:absolute;left:0;top:50%;width:3px;height:20px;transform:translateY(-50%);border-radius:0 9999px 9999px 0;background:var(--marigold,#f2b33d)}.ds-rail-count{margin-left:auto;min-width:20px;padding:0 6px;border-radius:9999px;background:var(--marigold,#f2b33d);color:var(--marigold-foreground,#1e2756);font-size:11px;font-weight:700;line-height:20px;text-align:center;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Status Badges",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "badge-pending",
      "description": "Word plus thread swatch on a wash; pending is dashed in the leave hue.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-badge ds-present\"><i class=\"ds-sw\"></i>Approved</span> <span class=\"ds-badge ds-pending\"><i class=\"ds-sw\"></i>Pending</span> <span class=\"ds-badge ds-absent\"><i class=\"ds-sw\"></i>Rejected</span>",
      "css": ".ds-badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;height:24px;padding:0 10px;border-radius:9999px;font:600 12px \"Anek Latin\",ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;white-space:nowrap}.ds-sw{display:block;width:10px;height:3px;border-radius:9999px}.ds-present{background:var(--present-wash,#e7f4ec);color:var(--present-ink,#22704a)}.ds-present .ds-sw{background:var(--present,#2f8f5b)}.ds-absent{background:var(--absent-wash,#faeae8);color:var(--absent-ink,#a42a21)}.ds-absent .ds-sw{background:var(--absent,#c8372d)}.ds-pending{background:var(--leave-wash,#e8f0fc);color:var(--leave-ink,#2257ad)}.ds-pending .ds-sw{background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,var(--leave,#2f6fd6) 0 3px,transparent 3px 5px)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "card",
      "description": "White work surface: hairline border, Raised shadow, 16px corners.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-card\"><h2 class=\"ds-card-title\">Today</h2><p class=\"ds-card-fig\">09:02</p><p class=\"ds-card-sub\">General shift 09:00–18:00 · grace until 09:15</p></div>",
      "css": ".ds-card{width:300px;padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--border,#e3e6f0);border-radius:16px;background:var(--card,#fff);color:var(--card-foreground,#141a33);font-family:\"Anek Latin\",ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;box-shadow:0 1px 2px hsl(228 40% 20% / .06),0 2px 6px -2px hsl(228 40% 20% / .08)}.ds-card-title{margin:0 0 16px;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.375}.ds-card-fig{margin:0;font-size:3rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.03em;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-card-sub{margin:8px 0 0;font-size:14px;color:var(--muted-foreground,#545b78)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Stitch Row",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "stitch-row",
      "description": "The month as one stitch per day: solid settled, dashed pending, hairline off; today marked in marigold.",
      "html": "<ol class=\"ds-stitch-row\"><li class=\"ds-day\"><span class=\"ds-thread ds-p\"></span><span class=\"ds-num\">1</span></li><li class=\"ds-day\"><span class=\"ds-thread ds-p\"></span><span class=\"ds-num\">2</span></li><li class=\"ds-day\"><span class=\"ds-thread ds-o\"></span><span class=\"ds-num\">3</span></li><li class=\"ds-day\"><span class=\"ds-thread ds-o\"></span><span class=\"ds-num\">4</span></li><li class=\"ds-day\"><span class=\"ds-thread ds-p\"></span><span class=\"ds-num\">5</span></li><li class=\"ds-day\"><span class=\"ds-thread ds-l\"></span><span class=\"ds-num\">6</span></li><li class=\"ds-day\"><span class=\"ds-thread ds-v\"></span><span class=\"ds-num\">7</span></li><li class=\"ds-day ds-today\"><span class=\"ds-thread ds-p\"></span><span class=\"ds-num\">8</span></li><li class=\"ds-day\"><span class=\"ds-thread ds-b\"></span><span class=\"ds-num\">9</span></li><li class=\"ds-day\"><span class=\"ds-thread ds-b\"></span><span class=\"ds-num\">10</span></li></ol>",
      "css": ".ds-stitch-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(10,28px);gap:4px;margin:0;padding:8px;list-style:none;font-family:\"Anek Latin\",ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-day{position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:6px 0;border-radius:10px}.ds-day:hover{background:var(--accent,#e9ecf7)}.ds-thread{display:block;width:100%;height:3px;border-radius:9999px}.ds-p{background:var(--present,#2f8f5b)}.ds-l{background:var(--late,#d9971c)}.ds-v{background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,var(--leave,#2f6fd6) 0 4px,transparent 4px 7px)}.ds-o{height:1px;background:var(--off,#c9cddb)}.ds-b{height:1px;background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,var(--off,#c9cddb) 0 3px,transparent 3px 6px)}.ds-num{font-size:11px;line-height:1;color:var(--muted-foreground,#545b78);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-today .ds-num{font-weight:700;color:var(--foreground,#141a33)}.ds-today::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;bottom:-8px;left:50%;width:4px;height:4px;transform:translateX(-50%);border-radius:9999px;background:var(--marigold,#f2b33d)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Quota Stitch",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "quota-stitch",
      "description": "A leave quota, one stitch per day: available solid, pending dashed, used hairline.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-quota\"><span class=\"ds-q ds-qf\"></span><span class=\"ds-q ds-qf\"></span><span class=\"ds-q ds-qf\"></span><span class=\"ds-q ds-qf\"></span><span class=\"ds-q ds-qf\"></span><span class=\"ds-q ds-qf\"></span><span class=\"ds-q ds-qf\"></span><span class=\"ds-q ds-qp\"></span><span class=\"ds-q ds-qp\"></span><span class=\"ds-q ds-qu\"></span><span class=\"ds-q ds-qu\"></span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-quota{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:3px;width:280px;height:3px;--lt:var(--lt-al,#4457c9)}.ds-q{flex:1;min-width:0;border-radius:9999px}.ds-qf{height:3px;background:var(--lt)}.ds-qp{height:3px;background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,var(--lt) 0 3px,transparent 3px 5px)}.ds-qu{height:1px;background:var(--off,#c9cddb)}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Running Stitch",
    "overview": "Every working day is a stitch. Attendance, shift windows and leave quotas are drawn as rows of short rounded threads, the way a nakshi kantha is sewn: a month reads at a glance as one stitched row, a shift as a seam pulled through the day, a quota as stitches still to be used. The stitch carries state through its form as well as its hue: a solid stitch is final, a dashed stitch is pending, a hairline is a day off or a day already spent. Colour is never the only carrier.\n\nThe world is an indigo-dyed shell on cool cotton. A deep indigo rail holds navigation; the working ground is a cool, faintly blue off-white (never cream); work happens on white cards with hairline rules and a barely-there lift. Status colours behave as thread, not as fills: they appear as thin marks, as accessible ink on a pale wash, and as chart series, each in its own validated step. One marigold is the needle: the active-nav stitch, today's dot, the head of the \"now\" needle, waiting counts. Dark mode re-dyes the same cloth indigo-black, brightens the threads, and lets marigold take over as the primary action colour.\n\nDensity is that of a working tool: one workhorse family (Anek Latin), compact 13 to 17px text, and a fixed figure ramp so that the one number that matters on a card (the clock, a count, a day total) clearly outranks everything near it. The category default this world refuses is the slate dashboard of identical KPI cards with a single blue accent.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
